        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 105.99000000000001,
          "end": 107.523,
          "en": "And how could we do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 109.11,
          "end": 110.49000000000001,
          "en": "Well, we could make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 110.49000000000001,
          "end": 113.85,
          "en": "that in our EventForm we use different methods",
