          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 146.19,
          "end": 151.19,
          "en": "and in EditEvent, I could set it to patch,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 152.52,
          "end": 154.74,
          "en": "so that would set the method of the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 154.74,
          "end": 157.893,
          "en": "and I could use the same form with different methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.94,
          "end": 161.04,
          "en": "Now how is this method helpful?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.04,
          "end": 163.11,
          "en": "Well, we can get access to that method here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 163.11,
          "end": 165.603,
          "en": "in our action on this request object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 166.62,
          "end": 169.863,
          "en": "there, we can extract the method like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 171.15,
          "end": 172.92000000000002,
          "en": "Now this method can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 172.92000000000002,
          "end": 174.6,
          "en": "to set the method of the request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 174.6,
          "end": 176.01,
          "en": "we're sending to the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 176.01,
          "end": 178.44,
          "en": "Again, here, we're still on the front end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.44,
          "end": 181.35,
          "en": "but we're sending a request to the dummy backend here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 181.35,
          "end": 184.14,
          "en": "And instead of hard coding, this method here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 184.14,
          "end": 187.23,
